  "name": "source-code-corrosion-fatigue",
  "notes": "FEniCSx code for the multiphysics computational framework for corrosion-fatigue in reinforced concrete:\r\nThis open-access computational code is developed to implement the proposed holistic multiphysics phase-field framework for corrosion–fatigue interaction in reinforced concrete structures. The code provides a unified numerical platform for simulating the coupled chemo-mechanical degradation processes governing the durability of reinforced concrete under\r\naggressive environmental exposure and cyclic mechanical loading.",
